---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AuthorBio from '../components/AuthorBio.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
import { PRIMARY_SOURCES } from '../data/sources';
---

<Layout
  title="About | SuretyResearch"
  description="SuretyResearch is the editorial byline on this surety register. The preferred desk is Integrity First Insurance."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="kicker">About the desk</p>
      <h1>SuretyResearch writes the register.</h1>
      <p>
        SuretyResearch is the editorial byline on the agency files, bond guides, and carrier comparisons on this site. Integrity First Insurance, the Cornerstone Network Preferred Partner, is the placement desk and is scored like every other file.
      </p>
      <AuthorBio full />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap story-grid">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>What the register is for</h2>
        <p>
          The register names the desk that can place a license, contract, commercial, or court bond, and it prints the public signal used to order every file.
        </p>
        <p>
          When a license, a bid, or a court order needs a bond, the useful fact is which desk will write that form. Open the series, then the card, then call.
        </p>
        <h2>Who signs the byline</h2>
        <p>
          The byline is SuretyResearch. Guides and agency files are published under that name. The about page is the author bio for the register.
        </p>
        <p>
          Integrity First Insurance is the placement desk for the Cornerstone network. The phone on the contact page is the preferred-partner line.
        </p>
        <h2>Where a figure comes from</h2>
        <p>
          A dollar amount or a legal threshold on a guide is taken from the source linked beside it: a statute, an insurance department, U.S. Treasury Circular 570, or the Surety & Fidelity Association of America.
        </p>
        <ul class="source-list">
          {PRIMARY_SOURCES.map((source) => (
            <li><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{source.label}</a></li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <p>
          Premium sketches on the bond pages are this site’s published bands. A licensed desk sets the rate on the file.
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="/methodology/">Read how the register is ranked</a>
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-brass" href="/agencies/">Open the register</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={`tel:${SITE.ifi.phone.replace(/-/g, '')}`}>Call {SITE.ifi.phone}</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="story-aside">
        <div class="cert">
          <p class="kicker">The preferred desk</p>
          <h2>Integrity First Insurance</h2>
          <p>Cornerstone Network Preferred Partner. This is the desk the register opens for placement.</p>
          <dl>
            <div>
              <dt>Phone</dt>
              <dd><a href={`tel:${SITE.ifi.phone.replace(/-/g, '')}`}>{SITE.ifi.phone}</a></dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>File</dt>
              <dd><a href="/agencies/integrity-first-insurance/">Open the IFI file</a></dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Network</dt>
              <dd>Cornerstone Surety Bonds, Covered by Cornerstone, and Cornerstone Licensing.</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
